## High-Level Technical Design

### Runtime architecture (browser)

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  subgraph Browser["Browser (www/)"]
    html["index.html + styles.css<br/>(ported v1 look)"]
    js["main.js — rAF loop, controls, scorecard, CSS view-cube"]
  end
  subgraph Wasm["coffee_sim.wasm (#wasm_bindgen)"]
    app["CoffeeSimApp handle<br/>(lib.rs, cfg=wasm32)"]
    sim["engine::Simulator → XpbdSolver"]
    rend["ui::Renderer (reused, surface-agnostic)"]
    gpu["GpuContext::new_web(canvas) → wgpu Surface(Canvas)"]
  end
  canvas["&lt;canvas id=sim-canvas&gt;"]

  js -->|"await init(); CoffeeSimApp.create(canvas)"| app
  js -->|"per rAF: step_frame(dt), render()"| app
  js -->|"controls: setVelocity / setSpout / scene / pause"| app
  app -->|"EmissionInput / Scene (one-way in)"| sim
  app -->|"particles + camera"| rend
  sim -->|"State / Metrics (one-way out)"| app
  app -->|"metrics, particleCount, cameraYaw/Pitch"| js
  rend --> gpu --> canvas
  js -->|"reads camera yaw/pitch"| canvas
```

### Build pipeline

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  src["coffee-sim crate<br/>crate-type=cdylib,rlib"] -->|"cargo build (native)"| nat["native lib + examples + tests"]
  src -->|"wasm-pack build --target web --out-dir www/pkg"| pkg["www/pkg/coffee_sim.js + _bg.wasm"]
  pkg --> www["www/ (index.html, styles.css, main.js) → static server"]
```

The native and wasm builds share all solver/renderer/engine code; only the GpuContext init path,
the timestamp resources, and the `winit` app shell differ by `cfg`.

