  - Covers R1. *Wasm target links:* `cargo build --target wasm32-unknown-unknown` compiles and links
    (with the placeholder handle) — the getrandom backend resolves via the rustflag.
  - Test expectation: no new unit tests (build-gate unit); verified by the two builds above.

